+[#table_sbi_covh_measurement_request]
+.CoVE Measurement Request Descriptor
+[options=header]
+|===
+| *Byte Offset* | *Field*           | *Size (bytes)* | *Description*
+| 00h           | COVEIOVersion     | 1              | CoVE-IO version
+| 01h           | DescriptorLength  | 4              | Total size of this descriptor, in bytes
+| 05h           | Reserved          | 3              | Must be 0
+| 08h           | MsmtReqAttr       | 4              | SPDM `GET_MEASUREMENTS` request attributes. Only the `RawBitStreamRequested` bit is valid; all other bits are reserved and must be 0. The TSM sets the `SignatureRequested` bit in the last `GET_MEASUREMENTS` request on behalf of the TVM.
+| 0Ch           | Reserved          | 4              | Must be 0
+| 10h           | Nonce             | 32             | Cryptographic nonce to use as the SPDM `GET_MEASUREMENTS` request `Nonce` field. If all 32 bytes are zero, the TSM generates a nonce on behalf of the TVM and ignores this field.
+|===
 
